02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C4, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;\n}\n/* latin */\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'Geist Mono';\n  font-style: normal;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-display: swap;\n  src: url(\"c7465573-9826-47eb-a819-fbedf6e0f00a\") format('woff2');\n  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;\n}\n<\u002Fstyle>\n<script src=\"1c19919d-7f12-4630-b6b4-982a1fa2ce5c\"><\u002Fscript>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F6F2;color:#111;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;scroll-behavior:smooth}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\na{color:#111;text-decoration:none}\na:hover{color:#0A6FC4}\n<\u002Fstyle>\n<\u002Fhelmet>\n<div style=\"font-family:Geist,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#111;background:#F7F6F2;min-height:100vh;padding:8px\">\n  <dc-import name=\"SiteHeader\" active=\"blog\" hint-size=\"100%,68px\" style=\"position:sticky;top:8px;z-index:50;display:block\"><\u002Fdc-import>\n\n  <article>\n    <header data-screen-label=\"Post / Header\" style=\"max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(40px,6vw,80px) 20px clamp(28px,4vw,40px);text-align:center\">\n      <a href=\"/blog\" style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#555\">← Web design guides<\u002Fa>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:22px 0 0;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,68px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-0.055em;text-wrap:balance\">How much does a website cost in India in 2026?<\u002Fh1>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:24px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;color:#555\">\n        <span style=\"font-weight:600;color:#111\">Author name<\u002Fspan><span>·<\u002Fspan><span>8 min read<\u002Fspan><span>·<\u002Fspan><span>Updated Oct 2026<\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fheader>\n    <div style=\"max-width:1320px;margin:0 auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;max-height:720px;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:#2EB0EC\"><image-slot id=\"blog-1\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" shape=\"rect\" placeholder=\"Blog cover (16:9)\"><\u002Fimage-slot><\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div data-screen-label=\"Post / Body\" style=\"max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(48px,6vw,80px) clamp(16px,3vw,32px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:clamp(28px,5vw,64px);align-items:start\">\n      <nav aria-label=\"Contents\" style=\"position:sticky;top:96px;border-radius:18px;background:#ECEBE6;padding:20px\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#666;margin-bottom:12px\">Contents<\u002Fdiv>\n        <ol style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 0 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:15px\">\n          <li><a href=\"#s1\">What affects the price<\u002Fa><\u002Fli><li><a href=\"#s2\">Typical price ranges<\u002Fa><\u002Fli><li><a href=\"#s3\">Where the money goes<\u002Fa><\u002Fli><li><a href=\"#s4\">How to keep costs down<\u002Fa><\u002Fli>\n        <\u002Fol>\n      <\u002Fnav>\n      <div style=\"grid-column:span 2;min-width:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#2A2A2A;text-wrap:pretty\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.55;color:#111\">A business website in India can cost anywhere from ₹15,000 to well over ₹5,00,000. The range is wide because \"a website\" covers very different things.<\u002Fp>\n        <h2 id=\"s1\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:96px;margin:40px 0 12px;font-weight:500;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#111\">What affects the price<\u002Fh2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px\">The biggest factors are the number of unique page designs, whether the design is custom or template-based, and what the site needs to do: take bookings, sell products, or simply describe your business.<\u002Fp>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px\">Content matters too. If you provide finished text and photos, the project moves faster and costs less.<\u002Fp>\n        <h2 id=\"s2\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:96px;margin:40px 0 12px;font-weight:500;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#111\">Typical price ranges<\u002Fh2>\n        <div style=\"margin:0 0 18px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #DDDCD6;background:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px\">\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEE\"><span>Simple business site, 5 pages<\u002Fspan><span>₹25,000 – ₹50,000<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEE\"><span>Custom-designed site with blog<\u002Fspan><span>₹70,000 – ₹1,50,000<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEE\"><span>E-commerce store<\u002Fspan><span>₹85,000 – ₹3,00,000<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;padding:14px 18px\"><span>Web app or portal<\u002Fspan><span>₹3,00,000+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"margin:28px 0;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#ECEBE6\"><image-slot id=\"post-diagram\" src=\"data:image/webp;base64,\" shape=\"rect\" placeholder=\"Diagram: cost breakdown\"><\u002Fimage-slot><\u002Fdiv>\n        <h2 id=\"s3\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:96px;margin:40px 0 12px;font-weight:500;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#111\">Where the money goes<\u002Fh2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px\">Roughly a third goes to planning and design, half to development and testing, and the rest to launch, SEO setup and support.<\u002Fp>\n        <h2 id=\"s4\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:96px;margin:40px 0 12px;font-weight:500;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.04em;color:#111\">How to keep costs down<\u002Fh2>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 18px\">Start with the pages that bring in customers, prepare your content early, and add features in a second phase once the site is earning.<\u002Fp>\n\n        <aside style=\"margin-top:44px;border-radius:20px;background:#111;color:#FFFFFF;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px\">\n          <div style=\"max-width:24em\"><div style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#BDBDBD\">Related service<\u002Fdiv><div style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.04em\">See fixed-price packages for website design.<\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n          <a href=\"/pricing\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:46px;padding:0 5px 0 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFE100;color:#111;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\" style-hover=\"background:#FFFFFF;color:#111\">View pricing <span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#111;color:#FFFFFF;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">↗<\u002Fspan><\u002Fa>\n        <\u002Faside>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Farticle>\n\n  <dc-import name=\"SiteFooter\" hint-size=\"100%,560px\"><\u002Fdc-import>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fx-dc>\n\n\n<\u002Fbody><\u002Fhtml>"